    "result_text": "The full test suite passes with `BUILD SUCCESS`.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `contactPreference` field on the owner API following the repo's existing derived-field pattern.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `contactPreference` property to the `Owner` schema (a read-only string enum of `EMAIL`/`PHONE`), matching the style of the other derived fields like `membershipLevel` and `locality`. The DTO (`OwnerDto`) is generated from this spec, so this creates the field and its `ContactPreferenceEnum`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` binding `contactPreference` to a new `contactPreference(owner)` helper that returns `EMAIL` when the owner's email is present (non-null, non-empty) and `PHONE` otherwise \u2014 the same approach the mapper already uses for `membershipLevel`, `locality`, etc.\n\nBoth new acceptance tests (`corePhoneWhenNoEmail`, `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) and the full suite pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`, Tests run: 2, Failures: 0, Errors: 0).",
